      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I didn't have issues at the time on my setup but now it's blocked on all platforms and requires settings that hinder performance to work at all.  It works now by tricking EAC into thinking it's not a VM by disabling all hw accel with the hypervisor extension disabled.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
